  "description": "\"A woman with red eyes brings a curse.\" \n\nThat She said, but no one than the rumored and beautiful royal daughter of the powerful house Shana, Rowena, changed the color of her pupils to red in a sudden fire one day. A legend that once descended on the continent. \n\n\"A woman with red eyes brings a curse.\"\n\nBecause of this legend, Rowena was abandoned overnight. With the help of his mother's friend and the guardian of the northern Werner region, the Duke of Conrad, she discovers that her eyes are not evidence of a curse, but of \"power\"... With the birth of 'Heinrich' from the palace 'Granzel', Rowena, who has been forced to take only bridal classes for arranged marriages because of the lack of estrangement from the throne, begins to move on her own rather than stand still... Clearly, someone is putting all the characters associated with them at risk. Rowena begins to investigate the cone that led to all of this.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59815455), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B2%84%EB%A0%A4%EC%A7%84-%EC%99%95%EB%85%80%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%98%EC%97%AD%ED%95%9C%EB%8B%A4/3742)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc33428), [German](https://www.delitoon.de/detail/dad_2000351), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/132161)",
